{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"获取代理商的相关信息，需提供代理商ids，可指定查询字段。需先通过【获取Access-Token】接口获取授权access-token。返回信息中包含返回码、返回信息、代理商列表等。相关附录文档有【附录-返回码】、【附录-客户状态】、【附录-客户角色】。\",\"id\":\"ad.agent.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/agent/info/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1697467936570371\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access-token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access-token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.return-code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1699633774328846\",\"reason\":\"用于解释接口返回的返回码和返回信息\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.customer-status\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760171535\",\"reason\":\"用于解释返回信息中用户状态的含义\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-客户状态\"},{\"id\":\"appendix.customer-role\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697577930691592\",\"reason\":\"用于解释返回信息中角色的含义\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-客户角色\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1697467936570371\",\"title\":\"获取代理商账户信息\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xrRPZVTa\">获取代理商信息</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201760596780631040%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-czppcFIq\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FRX3ln9q\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/agent/info/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/agent/info/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1697467936570371\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-r2cy9b2g\" id=\"link-1\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-k8dHRTJk\"><strong>GET</strong></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-EwaY3YBC\" id=\"link-2\">请求Header</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t1e39d7f-JektZ2LJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d